THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This project does not bundle FFmpeg or FFprobe binaries in source control.
They are downloaded at install time by `npm run setup:ffmpeg` from the
`eugeneware/ffmpeg-static` and `ffprobe-static` packages.

  FFmpeg / FFprobe -- LGPL v2.1 or later
  https://ffmpeg.org/

Runtime npm dependencies:

  express   -- MIT   https://github.com/expressjs/express
  multer    -- MIT   https://github.com/expressjs/multer
  ffmpeg-static   -- MIT   https://github.com/eugeneware/ffmpeg-static
  ffprobe-static  -- MIT   https://github.com/eugeneware/ffprobe-static

The REA project (https://github.com/morluto/rea, MIT) was evaluated during
design research only. It is not a dependency and none of its code is included
here. See docs/REA-RESEARCH.md.

The sample clips in examples/ are generated programmatically by
`npm run make-samples` using FFmpeg's synthetic video sources. They contain no
third-party material.

This project contains no source code, assets, fonts or branding from CapCut,
剪映, or any other commercial video editing product.
